      "summary_en": "Shaco becomes Invisible and teleports to target location. His first attack while Invisible is empowered, dealing bonus damage and critically striking if he attacks from behind.",
      "summary_zh": "萨科进入隐形状态并传送到目标位置。 他在隐形状态下的第一次普攻将获得增强，造成额外伤害并在目标背后攻击时必定会暴击。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
