      "summary_en": "Shaco's Shivs passively poison targets on hit, slowing their Move Speed. He can throw his Shivs to deal damage and poison the target. The thrown Shiv deals bonus damage if the target is below 30% health.",
      "summary_zh": "萨科的毒刃在命中时会被动地使目标中毒，减少目标的移动速度。他可以将毒刃扔向目标，造成伤害和中毒效果。扔出的毒刃会对生命值低于30%的目标造成额外伤害。",
      "wiki_source_ref_ids": [
        "source:wiki:1307774:3985833"
      ]
